IGNORA TESTA (60s, whistle, a ruler in her hand) measures the gap between pallino and ball.", "para": 1, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "In the front row, young KOFI ANTWI (10, orange soda, the only one not wearing white) watches.", "para": 1, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Aldo rolls.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "The ball curves, kisses the pallino, stops.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Eh!", "name": "LUCIA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's a touch.", "name": "PADRAIC", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's a foul.", "name": "CORMAC", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Touch. Aldo's.", "name": "TESTA", "speaker": 5, "ext": [], "paren": ["measuring"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Madonna.", "name": "CORMAC", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Cormac hurls his ball.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "It cracks into Lucia's, scattering the cluster.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Lucia lunges.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Padraic grabs her arm.", "para": 3, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Aldo grabs Padraic's collar.", "para": 3, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Testa blows the whistle, step-stepping between them with the ruler held like a sword, and Kofi stands on his chair, soda raised, and the entire club goes silent as the pallino rolls to a stop at the exact center of the court.", "para": 3, "sent": 5, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}]}